<div style="font-size: 16px; color: #111827;">
  <p>Hello {{name}},</p>

  <p>We received a request to reset your LawRoute password. Click the button
    below to reset it. This link will expire in 1 hour.</p>

  <p style="text-align: center; margin: 24px 0;">
    <a
      href="{{resetUrl}}"
      style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #1e3a8a; color: white; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;"
    >Reset password</a>
  </p>

  <p>If you did not request a password reset, simply ignore this email and your
    password will remain unchanged.</p>

  <p>Thanks,<br />The LawRoute Team</p>
</div>